== Walkthrough ==
[[File:npc_sultin.png|thumb|right|Sultin]]
Incandescent gear is Enchanter specific quested items from The Temple of Solusek Ro. Talk to Sultin.

=== Incandescent Gloves ===

Sultin needs to sew together four other sets of gloves to make these.{{CheckboxList}}
* Indifferent or higher faction with [[Temple Of Sol Ro]].
* [[Glowing Gloves]] are dropped randomly off [[a shadowed man]].
* [[Radiant Gloves]] can be found on [[Radiant]] in [[Cazic Thule]].
* [[Enchanted Gloves]] are obtained by bringing [[Tizina]] in [[Lavastorm Mountains]] 50gp.
* [[Gleaming Gloves]] are obtained by giving [[Tarn Visilin]] in [[Highpass Keep]] a [[bloodstone]].
{{End}}

